Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saraba chikyuu yo, tabidatsu fune wa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.22,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Farewell Earth, a ship is taking off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:32.73,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato}Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\pos(589,213)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:33.40,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(650,904)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\\pos(1402,642)}A New Voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ucyuu no kanata Iskandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's about to take off to Iscandar carrying the fate of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We'll return for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Smile back at the people waving their hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:01:02.95,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:01:02.95,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.70,0:01:33.80,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,Are you certain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:36.78,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I double-checked with Ginga's systems.{prove.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:39.46,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Iscandar executed a warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:44.22,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We don't think it was a natural phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:50.10,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Iscandar left orbit, and accelerated\N toward the Milky Way Galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:57.12,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,Someone can move a planet at will ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:02.28,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,Assuming that Iscandar \Nwarps out on the same line...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:06.00,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...the closest fleet we have is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:11.42,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:32.62,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}This is Melda Dietz, \Nthe Royal Attendant of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:37.46,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Identify your affiliation. \NI repeat, identify your affiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:38.44,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\pos(996,936)}Iscandar's been materialized in the current space-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:40.52,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,No loss of mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:43.15,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,No abnormality in atmospheric composition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:47.78,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I still hear the noise, Daeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:51.60,def2,{DADAR,0,0,0,,Looks like we brought it along with Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:55.12,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Our home, Dezariam, is still too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:03:03.44,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}In order to transport a whole planet, we have to repeat a jump in the current space-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:08.02,def2,{DEDAR,0,0,0,,For the millennial dream of Dezariam...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.46,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...Iscandar is all we need.{want.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:14.34,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We don't need the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:20.04,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,A dying planet... \NWhere has it been transported to ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:46.56,def2,{HILDE,0,0,0,,Watch out !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:13.78,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,So annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:16.60,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,They've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.24,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,Finally caught up, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:27.14,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,All ships, begin anti-aerial combat !\N Drive them out !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:47.94,def2,{WOLF,0,0,0,,Act as a shield for the migration convoy.\N Don't let even one ship get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:50.72,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet has begun to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:55.34,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,{At this rate, the Berger Fleet will\N be attacked from two sides.}At this rate, the Berger Fleet\N will face a bilateral attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:59.76,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,How about eliminating the enemy's \Nmain force with the Desler Cannon ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:04.78,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,No. That would damage the\N migration convoy in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.32,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Emergency message from the\N Royal Attendant of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:12.14,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Your Excellency... Your Excellency Desler...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:15.00,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Melda Dietz ?! Where are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:19.35,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,I'm engaged in combat. \NYour Excellency, please contact Lady Starsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:22.40,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{dasshutsu}She's refusing to evacuate. Please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:29.06,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,There's a way of saving them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:35.50,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,If we let them undergo the ritual so they can be\N accepted at Sanktel, as Melda has suggested...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:42.26,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,Do you know what it would mean to\Nput a human life through that ritual ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:46.00,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,{You don't know what the ritual does to human lives because you are too young, Yurisha.}Yurisha, you are too young \Nto grasp what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:53.94,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,But at this rate, {\i1}everything{\i0} will be lost !\N Sister, that's not for you to decide !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.88,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,Sasha has been kept like that because...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:13.44,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,So, the subspace gate can take us\N to the drifting Iscandar right away ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:15.44,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Then why don't we just go ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:20.66,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,{We're the closest, right ? \NWe owe Iscandar, right ?}We’re the closest, right?\NWe owe Iscandar for coming to Earth’s aid, don’t we?\N
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:23.66,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{That's why you're such a simpleton.}And this is why you're \Nseen as such a simpleton !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:29.62,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,The issue is, who blew up Planet Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.94,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{moshi}If it was the Bolar Federation...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:36.15,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,...our technology exchange \Nwith Garmillas will be canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:39.22,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{sekkaku}We've come this far to assemble this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.82,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{nande}Why ? \NEarth and Garmillas have a security treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:47.80,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{dakara}That could be broken, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:54.40,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{hetani}If we try to save Iscandar, Earth might be\N caught in a war between Garmillas and Bolar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:56.68,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{mikagiri}It's time to give up ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:07:02.14,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Earth has been hit by disasters, so we can't \Nafford to get involved in others' battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:07.84,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,I've heard the Garmillas refugees\N have landed on Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.28,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,, Can we at least rescue them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:14.36,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,Our enemy can move an inhabited planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:17.58,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,Combat will be unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:19.46,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,Command HQ won't approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:23.22,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,We just pretend not to see ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:33.24,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{Father, how would you talk to Yabu ?}Father, how would you talk to big bro Yabu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:40.60,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}He used to visit us, right ? \NHe's a clumsy but kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:45.20,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}This is just too cruel for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.20,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,I want to know your thoughts, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.10,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,The subspace gate is right ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:54.74,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,{jitai}...and the situation is time-sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:59.80,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,{minna}Everyone's on edge, and this\N voyage could be canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:01.98,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,What should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.58,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,{You can't do this, Yabu.}Don’t do this, big bro Yabu !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:07.44,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:10.66,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,No. You can't take a landing \Nboat without permission !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.68,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,What's with you guys ?\N I've gotta go !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:18.08,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,Hey, please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:19.46,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:24.50,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,It's suicidal to go through the \Nsubspace gate in a landing boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:25.26,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:33.94,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,This is a prototype core you've \Nbeen building on the Asuka, isn't it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:37.74,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yabu, you're stealing a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:45.10,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{It can travel through the gate, \Nbut what about after ?}It can help get you through \Nthe gate. But then what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.42,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Even if you're lucky enough to reach Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:50.14,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,I don't care !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:53.44,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,There's no place for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:57.04,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,No, I never had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:00.24,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,{dakara}That's why I went to Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:03.76,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,I finally found my place and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:05.72,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,...my family !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:12.48,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,{konna}Why was a useless dork like myself even born ?! \NWhat purpose do I even live for ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:17.54,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,{sono}My family gave me all the answers !\NIt's where I belong !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:30.68,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,I can't lose them. \NI won't allow that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:35.52,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,{kitto}They must be alive. \NI've got to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:38.96,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,You're right. They must be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:43.68,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,When your family is found, you have\N to be there for them, right Yabu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:45.82,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Please calm down and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:46.84,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:53.26,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Reality is cruel. \NThe worst always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:55.26,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Ryusuke !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:59.44,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Honest but clumsy people\N always become the target...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:05.52,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,...especially those fools who keep \Neverything to themselves until they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:13.64,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Let him do whatever he wants. \NWe all become desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.30,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Don't talk like you know !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:24.20,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you ?\N Why did you sneak onto the Yamato then ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:23.22,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,{\pos(296,992)\c&HFFFE9F&}Hey, Tasuke !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:26.54,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,You wanted to test Captain Kodai, didn't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:31.98,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,You wanted him to prove he'd be worthy of your father's death and the future of Earth !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:34.14,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,{sonna}No one can do that !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:38.88,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,If you had given up hope in people, \Nyou wouldn't have tested the Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:44.72,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,{kitai}You have hope, right ?!\NYou haven't given up, have you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:45.88,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,It's the same for us !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.02,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:52.70,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,I've seen enough.\N{This is it.\N} I'll leave the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:54.90,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Domon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:59.84,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{I was wrong for coming here.\N Just put me in a cell.}Coming here was a mistake.\NJust put me in a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:04.82,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,That'll save you work, right Hoshina ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.26,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:21.04,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,If we reach Iscandar, \Nwe won't be able to avoid combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.12,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,That'll endanger the future of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:27.96,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Ambassador Barrel understands that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:32.00,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,...even though he doesn't \Nknow his family's situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.60,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Thank you for what\N you've done for Yabu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:45.24,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:50.46,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Although the Captain is in a meeting,\N you have to tell him about your resignation.{removal request.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:52.80,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:54.80,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Do you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:59.02,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,You think you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:03.00,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,But you haven't seen anything,\Nor heard anything yet, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:14.26,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,70% of Earth's population was\N lost because of Garmillas attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:20.42,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{ima}And 70% of the Garmillas people were lost\N due to the destruction of their home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:25.80,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,What should we chalk this \Ncoincidence up to? "Karma” ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:28.62,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,No, that’s not a word I’d use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:33.92,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{kore}To me, this seems to\N be some kind of sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.76,0:12:37.36,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{chikyuu}Both Earth and Garmillas are equally scarred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:43.28,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{kako}We have to leave the past behind and\N help each other in the truest sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:47.60,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{daremo}The time is now, \Nwhen everyone's feeling anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:51.38,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{jibun}We shouldn't make decisions \Naccording to our own convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:56.44,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{kono}There are many humanoid\N life forms in this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:13:02.14,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{tairitsu}They're not for conflict, \Nbut for inspiration and improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:06.80,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,At least, humans believe so and act...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.30,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:13.44,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Is that an insight you gained\N in the higher dimension ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:20.10,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,No, I don't remember anything from then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:22.38,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:27.34,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,In the higher dimension, they say \Nall time lines exist in parallel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:34.88,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,If you remembered anything, \Nyou could see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:38.74,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{kono}In this world, everything is undetermined.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:44.50,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{sore}Even if you think you're right,\N we can't take any risks...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:51.48,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{chikyuu}...especially when the Earth ambassador with\N plenary powers, the Garmillas ambassador, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:14:00.60,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{chikyuu}...the fleet commander, who operates the \Nentire Earth force, are on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:02.44,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{zettai}No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.24,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:08.12,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.74,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Everyone's so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:23.06,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Don't you have to return\N to the Asuka, Caroline ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:27.12,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Why bother ? \NThe training will probably be canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.54,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Next time you call me\N by that name, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:34.58,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Oh, Tokugawa{Tokubawa}, you're the healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:36.70,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:38.86,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.46,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:48.94,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,The fleet will reach the subspace gate soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:53.80,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,The original plan was to jump all \Nthe way to the Magellanic Cloud, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:58.36,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Defense Fleet 65 has been recalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:04.80,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,We can't enter the gate. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:10.16,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,I understand your feelings, \Nbut on the Earth side...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.74,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Abnormality in the wave motion engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:18.78,def2,{YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}You can't stop the pressure increase ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:22.76,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,The energy condenser's begun \Nto melt down for an unknown reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:27.42,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Tasuke's job is to tamper \Nwith the wave motion engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:32.92,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Bando will re-write the damage control information, making the engine look like it's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:40.62,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Fire in the engine room.\N I'm sealing the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:50.02,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Just for 10 minutes, shut down access to the\N engine room to gain control of the Yamato's thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.48,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Once the ship enters the gate, \Nwe have no choice but to go forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:55.84,def2,{ANALYZER,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:57.84,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Once we get to Iscandar, we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:03.34,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{jiei}The Yamato can take necessary actions within the \Nscope of self-defense and humanitarian assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:07.42,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{crew}That must be the crew's wish. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:11.68,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,What's happening ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:14.62,def2,{SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,An evacuation order has been\N issued by the engine section.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.22,def2,{RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Please move to the Hyuga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.30,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.64,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,We'll escort the three big shots out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:25.84,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,This is not the intent of the Earth government.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:33.24,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{oretachi}The Yamato is heading to Iscandar because of a revolt by its new recruits, and we have to show it to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:37.32,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,This won't just end with only a discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:42.08,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,You can say no, but even\Nif it's just me, I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:56.90,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Game's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:18.76,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Your act of revolt and control of the ship's \Noperations is a serious offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:25.74,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you confide in\N me before taking action ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:33.02,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Don't you know I've done this before ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:46.72,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:50.42,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Hey, you there ! \NWhat's the meaning of this ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:58.06,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Attention. This is Kodai,\NCaptain of the Yamato speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:02.64,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Defense Fleet 65 will head to the Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:08.38,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{chikyuu}This is not by the order of Earth \NCommand HQ, but of our own volition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:13.34,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{shitagaenu}If you don't agree with this,\N let me know, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:16.78,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,...I'll ask the Garmillas patrol on the Magellan side of the gate to accommodate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:22.22,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,We're entering a battlefield. \NWe'll be in tough situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:28.00,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,But the Yamato is not just a battleship.\N She's the hope of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:34.02,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,We never lose hope, no matter what.\N She's the embodiment of human will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:37.00,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:41.54,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{aragae}Keep trying. \NSeek peace in a hateful conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:46.70,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{chikyuu}Based on human ideals, we'll try to\N save as many people as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:49.88,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{kakuin}I hope all of you will do your very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:59.02,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Oh man, we were forced out \Nof the bunch, weren't we ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:02.66,def2,{YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,The higher in rank you go,\Nthe more boring the job becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:06.32,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,On the other hand, the young \Nones can do the jobs they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:12.66,def2,{BARREL,0,0,0,,We'll have to talk to the\N government to ensure their status.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:19.76,def2,{SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Okita's children and their children\N are taking a step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.68,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Geshtam wall output down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:43.78,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Launch mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:52.32,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Defend the migration convoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:56.26,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,The damage is spreading out. \NDon't let them come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:20:00.46,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,We can't lose any more Gamilan lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:04.98,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Führer...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:06.84,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:08.46,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,I felt dizzy. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:09.42,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.16,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Transmission from the Crystal Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:17.02,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Abelt...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.02,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:23.20,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,What are you doing ? \NGet out of there at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:26.74,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Even if you have to desert Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:28.98,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:37.76,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We're Iscandar’s guardians.\NWe are unable to leave this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:44.90,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,Just as your kind can't live separated\Nfrom Garmillas for too long, neither can we...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:16.44,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Such a waste of resources and effort...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:19.96,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Iscandar is all we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:25.38,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We eliminated Planet Garmillas \Nbecause it hindered our purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:28.56,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Why do you keep resisting ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:32.94,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.70,0:21:36.50,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We are Dezariam. {NOTE. Spelling? Dezarian of the Planet Dezarium?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:40.44,def2,{MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}To those weak beings\N who don't leave any mark in history...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:42.68,def2,{DADAR,0,0,0,,Begone !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:07.68,def2,{DITZ,0,0,0,,What was that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:11.36,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:13.04,def2,{WOLF,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:27.84,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,So, you've come, Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\3c&H000008&\pos(536,1048)}Save Iscandar! Rebellion of the Young Heroes!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(210,874)\3c&H000008&}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:51.45,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(956,676)}Emergency Order! Yamato, Shoot Iscandar !!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:51.45,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(960,462)\3c&H000008&}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:59.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo}Behind the sorrow...\N{\i1}kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:04.58,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru}...happiness is always waiting for you{next}\N{\i1}tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:17.50,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou}Let's turn that fairy tale into truth\N{\i1}sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.12,0:23:29.16,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku}You whisper with a spark in your eye\N{\i1}anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:46.66,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai}You don’t dream to get hurt\N{\i1}yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.98,0:23:55.54,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ai wa ima mo hikari}Love still shines even now\N{\i1}ai wa ima mo hikari
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.55,0:24:02.66,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tada hitotsu no inori}There’s only one prayer\N{\i1}tada hitotsu no inori
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:11.77,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{mirai wa mou hajimatte iru}The future has already begun\N{\i1}mirai wa mou hajimatte iru
